            <fr:title text="Four communication tiers, four budgets">Four communication tiers, four budgets</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>Card</fr:taxon>
            <fr:meta name="anki">1786395975691</fr:meta>
            <fr:meta name="anki-deck">MLSys</fr:meta>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
  <html:p>Name the four communication tiers on a <fr:link href="/NZZ7/" title="TPU Architecture" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/NZZ7/" display-uri="NZZ7" type="local">TPU</fr:link>, fastest to slowest, with per-chip v5p numbers.</html:p>
  
  
  
 <html:div class="jms-callout" style="
  margin: 1.1rem 0;
  padding: 0.1rem 0 0.1rem 0.9rem;
  border-left: 2px solid rgb(63, 83, 127);
  "><html:span style="font-weight: 500; color: rgb(63, 83, 127);" /> 
  <html:details><html:summary><html:span class="foldout" style="font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 500; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);">Answer</html:span></html:summary>
  <html:ol><html:li><html:strong>HBM <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\leftrightarrow ]]></fr:tex> TensorCore</html:strong> — <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[2.8e12]]></fr:tex> B/s.</html:li>
    <html:li><html:strong>ICI</html:strong> (<fr:link href="/O14H/" title="Inter-chip interconnect" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/O14H/" display-uri="O14H" type="local">Inter-chip interconnect</fr:link>, chip to nearest neighbors) — <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[9e10]]></fr:tex> B/s per axis one-way, across 3 axes on v5p.</html:li>
    <html:li><html:strong>PCIe</html:strong> (host to its tray of chips) — <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[1.6e10]]></fr:tex> B/s, about <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[100\times ]]></fr:tex> slower than HBM.</html:li>
    <html:li><html:strong>DCN</html:strong> (host to host) — <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[6.25e9]]></fr:tex> B/s.</html:li></html:ol>

  The design rule that falls out: keep the bytes crossing each channel <html:strong>proportional to that channel's speed</html:strong>. Note also that a TPU<fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\to ]]></fr:tex>TPU transfer over DCN pays the whole chain — PCIe, NIC egress, NIC ingress, PCIe again.
</html:details>
</html:div>



